---
description: Выгрузить CF или CFE текущей ветки ITL
agent: code
---

Use this command only from an active `itldev/*` development branch worktree.

Run the helper from the current project directory:

If the agent shell tool supports `timeout_ms`, use `timeout_ms >= 3900000` so the outer shell outlives the 3600-second 1C Designer/Enterprise limit. If the Designer limit is higher, raise the outer timeout too. Do not use `120000 ms` or other short values.

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\.agents\skills\1c-workflow\scripts\run-itl-command.ps1 -- -Action export-dev-branch-result
```

Under `VERIFICATION_POLICY=warn`, the helper warns and exports without confirmation. Under `VERIFICATION_POLICY=block`, it stops and `/itl-check` must run first. On success with a non-empty `userReport`, return exactly that Russian Markdown report; it contains the verification decision and full CF/CFE and manifest paths. Do not paraphrase the report or read `console.log`. For failures, read only the last 80 lines of `logPath`.
